<title>POLAND: POLISH FOOD PRICES RISE 0.1 PCT IN OCT 20-30.</title>
<headline>POLISH FOOD PRICES RISE 0.1 PCT IN OCT 20-30.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices rose 0.1</p>
<p>percent in October 20-30 after rising 0.2 percent in the</p>
<p>previous 10 days and were 0.3 percent higher than in September</p>
<p>20-30, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>				    OCT 20-30  OCT 10-20   LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)	0.1	   0.2	  0.3  (1.2)</p>
<p> Bread				1.0	   0.2	  2.4  (1.6)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	  -0.5	  -1.5	 -9.7 (-5.5)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	-0.4	   0.0	  0.4  (2.1)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.3	   0.4	  1.0  (0.9)</p>
<p> Eggs				 0.9	   1.8	  5.8  (5.6)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period</p>
<p>ending on Month 3x.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
